{
  "$schema": "../schemas/role_rules.schema.json",
  "version": 1,
  "doc": "Deterministic, inspectable derivation of per-role metadata from the role's name and domain. Every rule whose `match` hits the role name (case-insensitive, anchored nowhere) contributes its capabilities, skills and tags; the domain contributes its defaults; the archetype comes from the upstream mandate unless a rule overrides it. Order matters only for single-valued fields (`archetype`, `trust`, `nucleus`), where the last matching rule wins. `mix harness.agents --explain <id>` prints which rules fired, so a wrong capability assignment is a fixable line in this file rather than a mystery.",
