      "why": "an earlier change: a role that writes Dockerfiles and may never build one reports its own work unverified. docker is T2; the role is T3."
    },
    {
      "match": "build reproducibility",
      "tools": [
        "mix.compile"
      ],
      "why": "an earlier change: forcing a compile from a cold _build is this role's core method, and it held mix.test without mix.compile. T0."
    },
