      "match": "semantic search",
      "tools": [
        "qdrant"
      ],
      "why": "an earlier change: the role held the qdrant skill and not the tool. tools.json marks qdrant present: false here, so on this machine the honest outcome is still unavailable; the grant is what lets it be available where Qdrant is."
